    {
      "id": "EZK.43.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:EZK.43.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "¶ And he said unto me, Son of man, thus saith the Lord GOD; These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the ordinances of the altar in the day when they shall make it, to offer burnt offerings thereon, and to sprinkle blood thereon.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.43.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:EZK.43.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt give to the priests the Levites that be of the seed of Zadok, which approach unto me, to minister unto me, saith the Lord GOD, a young bullock for a sin offering.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.43.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:EZK.43.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt take of the blood thereof, and put ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " on the four horns of it, and on the four corners of the settle, and upon the border round about: thus shalt thou cleanse and purge it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.43.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:EZK.43.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt take the bullock also of the sin offering, and he shall burn it in the appointed place of the house, without the sanctuary.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.43.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:EZK.43.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And on the second day thou shalt offer a kid of the goats without blemish for a sin offering; and they shall cleanse the altar, as they did cleanse ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with the bullock.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.43.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:EZK.43.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When thou hast made an end of cleansing ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", thou shalt offer a young bullock without blemish, and a ram out of the flock without blemish.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.43.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:EZK.43.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt offer them before the LORD, and the priests shall cast salt upon them, and they shall offer them up ",
